From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: h616: connect DE33 mixer to IOMMU

Connect DE33 mixer0 to H616 IOMMU master 0.
Without this mapping enabling sun50i-iommu removes the hardware
bypass for master 0 and the active display pipeline faults while
reading framebuffer memory.

Signed-off-by: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
@@ -192,6 +192,7 @@
 					 <&display_clocks CLK_MIXER0>;
 				clock-names = "bus", "mod";
 				resets = <&display_clocks RST_MIXER0>;
+				iommus = <&iommu 0>;
 				allwinner,planes = <&planes>;
 
 				ports {
